			"hadithnumber": 3463,
			"arabicnumber": 3463,
			"text": "Anas bin Malik said:“I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying: ‘The cure for sciatica is the fat from the tail of a Bedouin sheep (or wild sheep), which should be melted and divided into three parts, one part to be taken each day on an empty stomach.’”",
